WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.392
Allah gave Ilyas a light and chose him as a prophet, to warn his people.

2
00:00:04.792 --> 00:00:09.280
But his people knelt around a huge stone idol. They called it Baal.

3
00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:15.200
Ilyas said, Why do you not fear Allah? Only Allah deserves our worship!

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:19.680
The people just laughed, turned, and walked away. Not one of them listened.

5
00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:27.568
Then the land cracked, the crops withered, and not a drop of rain fell. The idol could do nothing to help.

6
00:00:27.968 --> 00:00:33.440
The people were sorry. Ilyas raised his hands in prayer, and Allah sent down sweet rain!

7
00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:42.720
Children, remember: Allah is One. Idols can do nothing. We ask only Allah, and we worship only Allah!
